OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPatchy rain
OL,6,Fturning heavy at times overnight,
OL,7,Fbefore clearing from the west towards
OL,8,Fdawn, but perhaps lingering around the
OL,9,Fcoast come dawn. Brisk southerly
OL,10,Fcoastal winds easing overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FAny persistent rain around
OL,13,Fthe coast soon clearing. Otherwise a
OL,14,Fmix of isolated showers and brighter
OL,15,Fspells during the morning, with
OL,16,Foutbreaks building for afternoon from
OL,17,Fthe west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
