OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FWednesday very windy with occasional
OL,7,Frain, heavier in west. Rain early
OL,8,FThursday, clearing to leave mainly
OL,9,Fdry, occasionally bright fare from
OL,10,Flate Thursday.
